{"D:\\wt\\lcfpoor\\vlog\\lcfpoor\\voz\\b012_t2.wav": {"text": "Freeze the rest of the can of tomatoes in a bag flat. Next time it's already measured, honey. Let me tell you what this supper meant back home. Eggs were a Friday supper at our house, honey. Mama made eggs for supper every Friday of the Depression, and nobody went to bed hungry. Keep a dozen eggs in the fridge at all times, and supper is never far off. From one egg in a sauce to one egg in yesterday's cold rice. Number 20 is Yesterday's Rice, page 95. Heat one tablespoon of oil on high and toss in a half cup of frozen peas and carrots with leftover meat. Push it aside and scramble one egg in the empty space. Add the cold rice and a tablespoon of soy sauce. The rice must be cold, honey, because fresh rice turns into paste. Rice goes in the fridge within an hour, eaten within three days. Last night's rice, one egg, and supper is on the table.", "words": [{"w": " Freeze", "s": 0.18, "e": 0.5}, {"w": " the", "s": 0.5, "e": 0.72}, {"w": " rest", "s": 0.72, "e": 1.0}, {"w": " of", "s": 1.0, "e": 1.2}, {"w": " the", "s": 1.2, "e": 1.3}, {"w": " can", "s": 1.3, "e": 1.54}, {"w": " of", "s": 1.54, "e": 1.68}, {"w": " tomatoes", "s": 1.68, "e": 2.14}, {"w": " in", "s": 2.14, "e": 2.62}, {"w": " a", "s": 2.62, "e": 2.8}, {"w": " bag", "s": 2.8, "e": 3.1}, {"w": " flat.", "s": 3.1, "e": 4.1}, {"w": " Next", "s": 4.2, "e": 4.44}, {"w": " time", "s": 4.44, "e": 4.76}, {"w": " it's", "s": 4.76, "e": 4.94}, {"w": " already", "s": 4.94, "e": 5.4}, {"w": " measured,", "s": 5.4, "e": 6.0}, {"w": " honey.", "s": 6.0, "e": 6.2}, {"w": " Let", "s": 6.78, "e": 6.96}, {"w": " me", "s": 6.96, "e": 7.06}, {"w": " tell", "s": 7.06, "e": 7.32}, {"w": " you", "s": 7.32, "e": 7.48}, {"w": " what", "s": 7.48, "e": 7.64}, {"w": " this", "s": 7.64, "e": 7.9}, {"w": " supper", "s": 7.9, "e": 8.24}, {"w": " meant", "s": 8.24, "e": 8.6}, {"w": " back", "s": 8.6, "e": 8.92}, {"w": " home.", "s": 8.92, "e": 9.82}, {"w": " Eggs", "s": 10.04, 